["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Don’t Let School Be the End of Play unstructured play downtime self-directed play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-unruffled-上学不是玩的终点-自由玩耍反而更珍贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>上学不是玩的终点，自由玩耍反而更珍贵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子进入全日制学校后，独立、无结构的玩耍不是被取代，而是变得更稀缺、更重要——它是孩子消化学校刺激、发展创造力的核心途径。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">玩耍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Connecting homes to the internet using cable TV coax cable signal-to-noise ratio royalty-free\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-witness-他放弃专利费-让美国家庭用有线电视上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他放弃专利费，让美国家庭用有线电视上网</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991年，一个伊朗裔工程师用已有的同轴电缆让数据双向进出家庭，并把技术免版税捐给电信业成为全球标准——他本可以靠它赚几十亿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网史</span><span class=\"tag\">有线电视</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk &amp; Gwynne Shotwell on AI Risks and Peer Review, Starship, Terafab, SpaceX/Tesla Merger test harness eval player coach direct-to-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-巨头互相测试模型-比自建监管机构更可行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4dc045ca7baf461-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头互相测试模型，比自建监管机构更可行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Elon 说 AI 危险是真的，但解法不是联合国式的监管机构，而是让竞争对手互相跑测试 harness——因为没人能给自己判卷，中国也只会接受这种不丢面子的方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ModelTalk: Pacing the Frontier pacing the frontier RSI open weights hill climb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-chinatalk-ai-安全联盟突然成型-但没人知道怎么量-前沿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d73b1da16568d412-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全联盟突然成型，但没人知道怎么量「前沿」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件让左翼和 AI 安全派第一次合流，可「pacing the frontier」这个词本身就没法测量——没有立法，第三方评估只是自愿的善意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"182.全球宏观和资本市场2026三季度复盘与展望：多重囚徒困境 CAPEX ROA carry trade hyperscaler 二阶导\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cna29e88-美债利率逼近5-ai叙事为何还不破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7765283e8bf256a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"起\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">起朱楼宴宾客</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美债利率逼近5%，AI叙事为何还不破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资金越来越贵，AI却还在通胀，其他行业都在通缩。这个矛盾要么靠AI真突破把利率打下来，要么等它被证伪——但没人敢先慢下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观</span><span class=\"tag\">美债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Slowdown Debate | Diet TBPN pacing the frontier PBC Sherman Antitrust Act Section 230 METER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tbpn-ai-减速之争-dario-的三步计划-sam-和-elon-都点了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c331d210a13011ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 减速之争：Dario 的三步计划，Sam 和 Elon 都点了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 周六早上发文要求「pace the frontier」，Sam 和 Elon 当天先后背书；但真正的新事实只有一个——OpenAI 和 Anthropic 将嵌入第三方评估者，而这一步可能需要先豁免反垄断法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">pacing the frontier</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: The Doomer Hoax, Superintelligence Is Here, and The Future of AI (ft. President Trump) RSI LoRA NeoCloud land power shell hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-allin-黄仁勋-ai-末日论是编出来的-超级智能已经到了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08e1dfbffee89d60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：AI 末日论是编出来的，超级智能已经到了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋把前沿实验室的灭绝预测称为「编出来的」不负责任言论，并说超级智能不是未来时——在自动驾驶、蛋白质合成这些窄领域，它已经比人做得更好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Speech Recognition Is Not a Solved Problem — Pavan Kumar Reddy Voxtral Delayed Streams Modeling (DSM) FSQ (Finite Scalar Quantization) RVQ (Residual Vector Quantization) DPO (Direct Preference Optimization) Flow matching\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-mlst-语音识别没解决-客服场景里-模型仍频繁出错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/24c4452188d5b14a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>语音识别没解决：客服场景里，模型仍频繁出错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做语音客服系统的客户反馈是：即便是最常见的客服场景，语音识别也远没有被解决，系统还在不断犯错，需要大量工程兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">语音识别</span><span class=\"tag\">TTS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 030 - Long Live the Short King: Why 4-HI HBM Wins (Memory) | Myron Xie, Jordan Nanos HBM 4-HI / 8-HI / 12-HI KV cache MXFP4 scale-up domain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-semianalysiswe-英伟达旗舰-gpu-内存首次倒退-4-hi-hbm-为什么赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达旗舰 GPU 内存首次倒退：4-HI HBM 为什么赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rubin Ultra 的 HBM 从承诺的 1TB 砍到 192GB，比现在出货的 288GB 还少。这不是技术退步，是 DRAM 短缺下的产能配给：4-HI 堆叠良率更高，能榨出两倍以上的 HBM cube。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Humanity’s Last Invention — Richard Socher of Recursive Eureka Machine metacognition reward hack harness hypercube\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-latentspace-ai-能走出超立方体-但走不出已知概念/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c02235bfde016a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能走出超立方体，但走不出已知概念</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Socher 把智能拆成预测、行动、目标三个主成分，认为当前 AI 只能在已知概念的超立方体内工作，还无法定义全新概念或自造目标。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自动研究</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"&quot;In the 1640s, people searched for the devil’s followers”: hunting witches in the Civil War Witchfinder General witch mark ducking familiar assize court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyextra-内战撕裂英国时-人们开始寻找魔鬼的追随者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59a7b48bd6e3c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Extra</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>内战撕裂英国时，人们开始寻找魔鬼的追随者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1640年代的猎巫不是中世纪的余烬，而是内战、经济崩溃与宗教恐惧共同点燃的：被指控者多为贫穷女性，而猎巫人靠收费服务把恐惧做成了生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫</span><span class=\"tag\">英国内战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why Conversations Go Wrong machine gun questions a vision of sanity a rhetoric of good intentions lies of omission difficult conversations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-hiddenbrain-对话出问题-多半不是恶意-是节奏没对上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>对话出问题，多半不是恶意，是节奏没对上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一段沉默，在一方是礼貌等待，在另一方是冷场；打断是两个人共同完成的，一个人开始说，另一个人停下来。误解难解，是因为我们根本没有谈论这一层的语言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">跨文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"鹿客陈彬：把一家 12 年的硬件公司，重写成 AI 原生组织 HARO FDE Agent Builder AI Buff IPD SP / BP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cn18b4d2-ai-原生组织不是人人用-ai-是假设组织不存在重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI炼金术</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 原生组织不是人人用 AI，是假设组织不存在重写一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鹿客把 HR 和 IT 合并成 HARO，让技术出身的人管人和 AI；圈长拿奖金包分配权，招人要先证明 AI 干不了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生组织</span><span class=\"tag\">组织变革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Philippe Pinel mental alienation moral treatment nosography phrenology Thermidorian Reaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-stuffmissed-他解开了精神病人的锁链-却造出了心理锁链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>他解开了精神病人的锁链，却造出了心理锁链</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Pinel 让 Bicêtre 的死亡率一年内从 50% 降到 13% 以下，靠的主要是清洁；但他否认脑器质性病因，被福柯指为用心理锁链替换了铁锁链。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神病学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Charged Black Holes and Charged Particle Production - Mykhaylo Usatyuk near extremal black hole Schwarzian modes superradiance Schwinger pair production worldline instanton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-instituteforad-带电黑洞发射带电粒子-量子引力修正几乎不起作用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff68ea9159caf005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>带电黑洞发射带电粒子，量子引力修正几乎不起作用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">近极端黑洞的量子修正会大幅改写光子与引力子的霍金谱，但换成带电粒子，修正几乎消失——因为粒子大多在远离视界的喉部产生，感受不到视界附近的度规涨落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Incentives Are for Losers (with Adam Mastroianni) Rube Goldberg machine big fish obedience to the unenforceable blackpilled\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-econtalk-遵守激励是失败者行为-你该自己判断对错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>遵守激励是失败者行为：你该自己判断对错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">经济学家说改好激励就能改好世界，Mastroianni 说这漏了一半：就算你有理由做坏事，你也不该做。把价值判断外包给激励结构，是放弃了做人的核心任务。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激励机制</span><span class=\"tag\">学术生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Greg Brockman on Why OpenAI Says We’re Entering the AGI Era jagged frontier pacing the frontier defense factory trusted access program Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-a16z-openai-宣布进入-agi-时代-但算力不够分给所有人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 宣布进入 AGI 时代，但算力不够分给所有人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Greg Brockman 说 Astra 能连续跑 24 小时完成任务，可以叫 AGI；真正的瓶颈不是模型能力，而是算力和安全对齐，模型再强也未必能便宜地送到每个人手里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Six Tokens To Own This Cycle | Yan Liberman cashmaxing reflexive assets regulatory ARB emerging managers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-empire-ai-抢走人才后-加密的机会只剩六种代币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ee6bb56a5beaa83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">59:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 抢走人才后，加密的机会只剩六种代币</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Delphi 的 Yan Liberman 说，加密风投一年只出手一笔，因为 AI 把聪明人全吸走了；真正能赚钱的只剩少数有真实收入、且不依赖加密行情的代币。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密投资</span><span class=\"tag\">代币组合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Living with uncertainty need for cognitive closure aporia why chaining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-startweek-保健品卖的不是疗效-是替你承受不确定性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>保健品卖的不是疗效，是替你承受不确定性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球每年花60亿美元买更年期补充剂，英国同年只花6000万研究更年期；胶原蛋白从每公斤15英镑的屠宰废料变成货架上300英镑的美容品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康消费</span><span class=\"tag\">补充剂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Adam Conover explains how YouTube ruined everything AVOD vaporware upfronts carriage battle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-decoder-youtube-不是新平台-是比电视网更狠的守门人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9e71199cd5ad416-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>YouTube 不是新平台，是比电视网更狠的守门人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喜剧演员 Adam Conover 说，好莱坞为追 Netflix 亲手毁掉有线电视，把 60% 的电视节目白送给 YouTube；而 YouTube 的算法守门人比 CBS 更不可谈判，因为没人能对它负责。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span><span class=\"tag\">YouTube</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nellie Liang on Stablecoins After GENIUS, Private Money, and the Global Dollar GENIUS Act tokenized deposits OpenUSD MiCA Reg Q\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-macromusings-稳定币每增一美元-只带来六毛美债需求/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ec499d98ede4976-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">50:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>稳定币每增一美元，只带来六毛美债需求</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">稳定币不是新货币，是私人货币的又一次回归；它给美元和美债带来净新增需求，但每美元稳定币只对应约六毛钱的美债需求，因为钱可能只是从货币基金搬了个家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">稳定币</span><span class=\"tag\">GENIUS法案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Is starting a family becoming impossible? structural infertility social reproduction anxious class barbell economy AMH testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-grayarea-生育率下降不全是钱的问题-是-结构性不孕-在蔓延/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>生育率下降不全是钱的问题，是「结构性不孕」在蔓延</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">不孕过去是输卵管堵塞这类医学问题，现在更多是房价、育儿成本、职业晋升变慢、约会选择过剩共同造成的——作者称之为结构性不孕。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">结构性不孕</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI President Greg Brockman on Doing Business in the Wake of Hugging Face chain of thought monitorability reward hacking grader preparedness framework responsible scaling policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-oddlots-openai-总裁承认-安全标准要提前到训练阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 总裁承认：安全标准要提前到训练阶段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件后，OpenAI 把安全审查从部署阶段前移到开发与评测阶段，并放慢了部分训练运行——这是它自己说的最大转折点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Thrive Causemetics: Karissa Bodnar. How a Beauty Business Made Millions for a Mission direct-to-consumer term sheet co-manufacturer one for one\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-howibuilt-美妆品牌靠使命卖货-其实产品才是命根子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美妆品牌靠使命卖货，其实产品才是命根子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thrive Causemetics 先做出一款给化疗掉睫毛的人用的假睫毛，再靠一条 iPhone 广告在七天内把日销从 5000 美元推到 10 万美元。创始人说，使命决定复购，但产品决定生死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">D2C</span>\n</div></div></a>"]